# Graphify
# Keep machine-local caches, absolute paths, and generated HTML out of git.
# Only queryable team graph products (graph.json, GRAPH_REPORT.md, manifest.json) are shared.
**/graphify-out/*
!**/graphify-out/graph.json
!**/graphify-out/GRAPH_REPORT.md
!**/graphify-out/manifest.json
!**/graphify-out/wiki/
!**/graphify-out/obsidian/
.graphify/
.graphify_*.json
